:'''Stern Silvermane Guard:''' Hey! Commander Bronya is waiting for you all down below. Hurry up and go see her. And no tricks!
:'''March 7th:''' Are we... in a lot of trouble?
{{Dialogue End}}

===Confront the Silvermane Guards outside the hotel{{subst:void|<!--101020208-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Administrative District|update|On the first night of the trailblazing expedition, you don't sleep as soundly and at ease as you did on the Express.<br />It's not because you have some kind of close bond with the Express but because you keep hearing the sound of troops moving around as you sleep.<br />And now, you know exactly where the noise is coming from &mdash; it's undoubtedly the doing of the noble-looking girl and her troops in front of you.<br />They don't seem to be friendly. Go and ask them what they want.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''March 7th:''' Huh? It's you... you were there at the Fort...
:'''Bronya:''' I am Bronya Rand, acting commander of the Silvermane Guards. In the name of the {{Rubi|Amber Lord|Qlipoth}} in the highest, and under order of Supreme Guardian Cocolia Rand, I hereby arrest the suspected infiltrators under the charge of plotting to incite rebellion.
:'''Bronya:''' As agent of the supreme guardian, I herewith temporarily strip you of your freedom of action and speech. When you are tried by the adjudication panel, you will be given the opportunity to defend yourselves against the accusations.
:'''Bronya:''' Resistance will prove futile. You must come with me.
:'''March 7th:''' Looks like we've been downgraded to accomplices... again. Seems like it's every third planet this happens.
:'''Dan Heng:''' That's because you always act without thinking &mdash; you never have a plan.
:'''March 7th:''' Hey, I'm improving! I'm coming up with a plan right now... aaaand... got one!
:'''March 7th:''' (Trailblazer), Dan Heng, the alley!
:'''Dan Heng:''' The one that's been sealed off... Hmm, it's possible.
:'''Dan Heng:''' (Trailblazer), March, be ready to make an escape.
:'''March 7th:''' Huh? Really? I just wanted to say something...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's now or never!
